"Mark Healey" <die@spammer.die> wrote:

> I find that I wind up having lots of stuff that I have
> to leave in little piles under boulders before I find
> a good base camp spot.  When I do find one I usually
> have to make multiple trips to retrieve my goodies.

> Pets will pick up stuff and drop it.  Is there a way to control it
